# Copy this file to `.env.local` for local development. None of the values
# below are secrets — they're checked into source control as documentation
# of the runtime contract.
#
# In production (Vercel project settings → Environment Variables), set:
#
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://sharaafnazeer.com
#
# for the Production environment, and leave it unset (or set to the deploy
# URL) for Preview environments. The fallback in `src/lib/site.ts` already
# points at the canonical production domain, so the site builds correctly
# even if this variable is missing.

# Canonical, fully-qualified base URL. Used by metadata, the sitemap,
# robots.txt, RSS/Atom feeds, JSON-LD structured data and Open Graph
# image URLs. No trailing slash.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://sharaafnazeer.com
